<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower. Demand and supplies were light. Top $56.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 54.50-55.50, few 56.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 40.00-45.00</p>
<p>		 400-500 lbs. 43.00-46.00, few 450-500 lbs. 47.00</p>
<p>		 500-600 lbs. 46.00-49.00, few 50.00</p>
<p>		 few over 600 lbs. 48.00-50.00, few 51.00</p>
</text>
